 "name_en": "Overhead Cost Accounting (J54)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Overhead Cost Accounting (J54)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiob5a0247c922741818e2a456d1afa3b35\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob5a0247c922741818e2a456d1afa3b35__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item covers transaction-based actual postings that are used in overhead cost controlling. The purpose of overhead cost controlling is the planning, allocation, control, and monitoring of overhead costs.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Cost center accounting takes the costs incurred in a company and allocates them to the actual subareas that caused them. During period-end closing, these costs are distributed to cost centers through automatic allocation. By allocating the cost elements to cost centers in overhead cost controlling, you can control your costs and compare plan and actual costs. The plan/actual comparison at the end of the period helps you to plan, control, and monitor cost behavior. Overhead cost controlling is also a prerequisite for further allocating overhead costs to cost objects (CO-PC), which enables you to conduct a period-specific profitability analysis.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob5a0247c922741818e2a456d1afa3b35__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Record primary costs to cost centers by posting journal entries with reference to a cost center</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Update cost center with the correct values</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post statistical key figures (for use in reporting or as tracing factors for period-based allocations)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Distribute primary and secondary costs using an assessment cost element</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Run the cost centers actual data reporting</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reassign costs and revenues</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze allocation flow</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Maintain and monitor your cost center budget (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Transfer cost center budget</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob5a0247c922741818e2a456d1afa3b35__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Get a transparent view for an account of a cost center</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process a journal entry for various purposes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Determine availability of steps required for preparing periodic and year end activities</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Determine necessary steps for preparation of periodic and year end activities</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Track commitments posted on cost centers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Experience no undesired budget over runs and full transparency of the consumed and available budget at any time</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>间接费用成本会计 (J54)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiob5a0247c922741818e2a456d1afa3b35\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob5a0247c922741818e2a456d1afa3b35__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目涵盖用于间接费用成本控制的基于交易的实际过账。间接费用成本控制的目的是计划、分配、控制和监控间接费用成本。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">成本中心会计采用公司中产生的成本，并将其分配到产生这些成本的实际子范围。在期末关账期间，这些成本通过自动分配分配到成本中心。通过在间接费用成本控制中将成本要素分配到成本中心，您可以控制成本并比较计划成本和实际成本。期末的计划/实际比较可帮助您计划、控制和监控成本行为。间接费用成本控制也是将间接费用成本进一步分配到成本对象 (CO-PC) 的前提条件，这使您能够执行期间特定的获利能力分析。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob5a0247c922741818e2a456d1afa3b35__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过参考成本中心过账日记账分录，将初级成本记录到成本中心</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用正确的值更新成本中心</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账统计关键指标（用于报表或作为基于期间的分配的跟踪因素）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用分摊成本要素分配初级和次级成本。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">运行成本中心实际数据报告</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">重新分配成本和收入</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分析分配流</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">维护和监控成本中心预算（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">转移成本中心预算</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob5a0247c922741818e2a456d1afa3b35__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">获取成本中心科目的透明视图。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">出于各种目的处理日记账分录</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确定准备定期和年末活动所需的步骤。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确定准备定期和年末活动的必要步骤。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">跟踪成本中心上过账的承诺</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">避免不必要的预算超支，随时全面了解已消耗预算和可用预算</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
